        "original_id": "936701ff-86be-5c43-b929-eeda5f14e2ad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"State of Grace\", \"Begin Again\", \"Red\", \"I Knew You Were Trouble\"\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Concepts: promotional singles, official singles, re-issued singles\n\nFacts:\n- On September 25, 2012, Big Machine Records initially released \"Begin Again\" as a promotional single.\n- On October 1, 2012, \"Begin Again\" became the second single from \"Red\".\n- \"Begin Again\", \"Red\", and \"I Knew You Were Trouble\" were later re-issued as official singles.\n- \"State of Grace\" was the only promotional single from \"Red\" that was not re-issued as an official single.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
